// 功能包模板的类型检查：模板文件当作在站点的 app/features/collab/ 里，站点的 @/lib/* 与 react-router typegen 的 ./+types/* 换成这里的桩。
// journal.tsx 与 journal-body.tsx 引用站点 fumadocs-mdx 生成的 .source/browser，只在生成出的站点里检查
{
  "extends": "../../../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "lib": ["ES2023", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "rootDirs": ["../../template", "./route-types"],
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["./app/*"]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "../../template/routes.ts",
    "../../template/site.server.ts",
    "../../template/feature.tsx",
    "../../template/mdx.ts",
    "../../template/tasks.tsx",
    "../../template/record.tsx",
    "../../template/calendar.tsx",
    "../../template/record-links.ts",
    "../../template/repo-links.ts",
    "../../template/project-file.ts"
  ]
}
